[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2892219\">7045A10</a>\n                                           (right and left)</p><p>1. Undo the bolts securing the guide cover mouldings.</p><p>2. Remove the mouldings.</p><p>3. Undo the side bolts (3a and 3b) securing the seat. When the bolt\n(3b) is unscrewed, the lever (3c) is lifted, which places the seat\nbelt pretensioner mechanism in a &quot;safe&quot; condition.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Check that the lever (3c) is in\nthe correct position, i.e. locked in the disarmed position.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>4. Remove the seat.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the seat is not\ndamaged.</p><p>Fit the seat.</p><p>Tighten the seat side bolts.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Side bolt</p></td><td><p>CENTRAL FRONT SEAT</p></td><td><p>M10 x 1.25</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>3.4</p></td></tr></table></div><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Do not use impact tools for tightening.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>Fit the mouldings and fix them with the\nbolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/2892219\">7045A10</a>\n                                           (right\nand left)</p>"]]